<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE CLEARS MYTILINEOS OFFERING.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE CLEARS MYTILINEOS OFFERING.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the public offering prospectus of metals trading frim Mytilineos which will transfer to the bourse's main market.</p>
<p>The company will issue 880,000 new common bearer shares. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
